          "headline": "Building Multimodal Data Pipelines with Snowflake",
          "summary": "DeepLearning.AI launches a new free course in collaboration with Snowflake teaching how to process images, audio, and video into structured text. Learn to build OCR/ASR pipelines, Vision Language Model workflows with timestamped video descriptions, and multimodal RAG systems that retrieve across slides, audio, and video to answer questions with citations. Embed all modalities into shared vector spaces for cross-modal search and retrieval on real-world datasets.",
